{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:2026-10-19-official-40b84d6dd7e4","title":"腾讯混元 Hy-Memory-30B-A3B-GGUF 上架：本地记忆写入模型怎么跑","date":"2026-10-19","updated":"2026-10-19","summary":"腾讯混元 Hy-Memory-30B-A3B-GGUF 上架：本地记忆写入模型怎么跑","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-19-official-40b84d6dd7e4/wordmark-wide-49d62a5a26fd.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"2026-10-19-official-40b84d6dd7e4","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"Hy-Memory-30B-A3B-GGUF","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-Memory-30B-A3B-GGUF","source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<p>腾讯混元官方模型列表新增 tencent/Hy-Memory-30B-A3B-GGUF，三档量化文件已经公开，最小的 Q4_K_M 只有 18.24 GB。它不是一个聊天模型，而是专门给长期记忆框架当“写入员”的模型：决定哪些对话值得留下、写成什么格式、旧记忆怎么更新。这篇文章只回答一个问题——你现在能不能把它跑在自己的机器上，以及跑起来之后它到底替你做什么。</p>\n<h2>它是什么：专门写记忆的模型</h2>\n<p>Hy-Memory-30B-A3B 是腾讯混元开发的紧凑型长期记忆写入模型，官方说明它直接替换 Mem0、MemOS 和 Hy-Memory 框架里的通用大模型，覆盖 Chat、Working、Coding 三种场景。你可以把它想象成快递分拣中心里专门负责贴面单的人：包裹（对话内容）进来，他决定哪件要进长期货架、面单上写什么、旧面单要不要撕掉重贴。总参数 30B，但每次激活大约 3B，相当于分拣中心很大，真正干活的只有一条流水线。</p>\n<p>训练分两个阶段：先进行 Memory On-Policy Distillation，让模型在真实部署的框架配置里跟着教师信号学写状态链；再做 Attributed Memory Reinforcement Learning，按记忆块给分，把选好的记忆库带到下一个窗口。官方说这样训练出来的模型可以直接迁移到没见过的 EverMemOS 框架。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-19-official-40b84d6dd7e4/official-release-mechanism-landscape.png\" alt=\"AI 机制示意\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<h2>三档量化与官方成绩</h2>\n<p><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-19-official-40b84d6dd7e4/source-evidence-1-3dbf14f3.png\" alt=\"官方公告｜三档量化与评测成绩\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>仓库提供三种 GGUF 量化，全部通过 llama.cpp --check-tensors、真实 no-think 生成和完整量化评测：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量化档位</th>\n<th>文件名</th>\n<th>体积</th>\n<th>LoCoMo Judge</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Q6_K imatrix</td>\n<td>hy3a3b-memrl1009-step250-Q6_K-imat.gguf</td>\n<td>24.71 GB</td>\n<td>58.78% (154/262)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q8_0</td>\n<td>Hy-Memory-Step250-Q8_0.gguf</td>\n<td>31.99 GB</td>\n<td>57.63% (151/262)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q4_K_M imatrix</td>\n<td>hy3a3b-memrl1009-step250-Q4_K_M-imat.gguf</td>\n<td>18.24 GB</td>\n<td>56.49% (148/262)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>官方评测固定 20% LoCoMo 测试集，用 2 个用户、262 道题、59 个记忆块，检索 top_k=10，记忆温度 0.7，嵌入模型 qwen3-embedding-8b-for-online，裁判模型 gpt-5.6-sol，推理框架是官方 llama.cpp 指定 commit，KV cache 用 F16。Q6_K imatrix 是这次评测里质量最高的档位，Q4_K_M imatrix 则是下载和内存占用最小的档位。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-19-official-40b84d6dd7e4/source-evidence-2-47e9fdaa.png\" alt=\"官方公告｜跨框架平均成绩\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<h2>官方跨框架成绩：能说明什么</h2>\n<p>官方在固定 20% 基准矩阵上做了跨框架对比，只换 memory writer，框架版本、提示词、检索配置、答案模型和裁判全部固定。六个指标等权平均，四个框架再等权平均：</p>\n<p><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-19-official-40b84d6dd7e4/source-evidence-3-772e172e.png\" alt=\"官方公告｜llama.cpp 启动命令\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Memory writer</th>\n<th>Mem0</th>\n<th>Hy-Mem.</th>\n<th>MemOS</th>\n<th>EverMem.</th>\n<th>Avg.</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Hy-Memory-30B-A3B</td>\n<td>54.02</td>\n<td>60.55</td>\n<td>50.51</td>\n<td>56.89</td>\n<td>55.49</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude Opus 5</td>\n<td>53.43</td>\n<td>60.53</td>\n<td>50.50</td>\n<td>54.04</td>\n<td>54.62</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepSeek V4.1 Flash</td>\n<td>49.73</td>\n<td>60.20</td>\n<td>49.17</td>\n<td>55.47</td>\n<td>53.64</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hy3</td>\n<td>45.99</td>\n<td>58.06</td>\n<td>50.19</td>\n<td>52.30</td>\n<td>51.63</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qwen3.6-35B-A3B</td>\n<td>47.51</td>\n<td>55.87</td>\n<td>47.36</td>\n<td>50.75</td>\n<td>50.37</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hy3-A3B Base</td>\n<td>40.20</td>\n<td>50.39</td>\n<td>49.05</td>\n<td>50.98</td>\n<td>47.66</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qwen3-30B-A3B</td>\n<td>39.81</td>\n<td>45.67</td>\n<td>45.44</td>\n<td>46.57</td>\n<td>44.37</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>这些数字是官方报告的成绩，不是独立第三方复现。它能说明：在官方设定的条件下，Hy-Memory-30B-A3B 的平均分高于 Claude Opus 5 和 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash。它不能说明：在所有真实业务里都更好，也不能推出对手价格高低，更不能直接喊“最强”。</p>\n<h2>本地跑起来的最小路径</h2>\n<p>官方推荐用最近的 llama.cpp 正式构建，并给出在指定 commit 上验证过的启动命令。核心参数是 64K 上下文、单槽位、F16 KV 缓存、no-think 模式：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">llama-server \\\n  --model ./hy3a3b-memrl1009-step250-Q6_K-imat.gguf \\\n  --alias hy-memory-q6-k-imat \\\n  --host 127.0.0.1 \\\n  --port 8000 \\\n  --n-gpu-layers all \\\n  --flash-attn on \\\n  --ctx-size 65536 \\\n  --parallel 1 \\\n  --batch-size 2048 \\\n  --ubatch-size 512 \\\n  --cache-type-k f16 \\\n  --cache-type-v f16 \\\n  --temp 0.7 \\\n  --top-k 0 \\\n  --top-p 1.0 \\\n  --repeat-penalty 1.0 \\\n  --jinja \\\n  --chat-template-kwargs '{&quot;reasoning_effort&quot;:&quot;no_think&quot;}' \\\n  --check-tensors\n</code></pre>\n<p>如果想开两个并发槽位，官方要求把 --ctx-size 调到 131072，才能给每个请求保留最多 64K 上下文。启动后既可以用 OpenAI Python SDK 调用，也可以直接 curl 本机 8000 端口，请求里显式带上 reasoning_effort=no_think，方便审计。</p>\n<h2>现在能做什么，还不能做什么</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>现在就能从 Hugging Face 下载三档 GGUF，按官方命令用 llama.cpp 起服务，接入 Mem0、MemOS 或 Hy-Memory 当写入模型。</li>\n<li>官方成绩显示它在固定基准上平均分高于 Claude Opus 5 和 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash，但这是官方口径，需要你自己在真实数据上复测。</li>\n<li>权重文件开放下载，不等于你的电脑一定能跑：Q4_K_M 也要 18.24 GB，显存或内存不够就得降档或换设备。</li>\n<li>它不是通用聊天模型，不要拿它当日常对话助手；它的价值只在长期记忆写入这一条流水线上。</li>\n<li>下一步验收方法：用你自己的对话数据跑一遍记忆写入，检查它留下的记忆是否准确、更新是否及时，再决定是否替换现有框架里的通用模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关资源：框架代码与评测工具在 GitHub 的 Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory，GGUF 权重与模型卡在 Hugging Face 的 tencent/Hy-Memory-30B-A3B-GGUF，原始 BF16 模型在 tencent/Hy-Memory-30B-A3B，技术报告编号 2610.22196。</p>\n<h2>官方资料</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-Memory-30B-A3B-GGUF\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-Memory-30B-A3B-GGUF\">腾讯混元 官方发布说明</a></li>\n</ul>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:2026-10-23-official-3a68097e4e1d","rawId":"obsidian:2026-10-23-official-3a68097e4e1d","slug":"2026-10-23-official-3a68097e4e1d","legacyPaths":[],"title":"腾讯 Hy-Nomas 开放权重：一张 RTX 4090 能跑怎样的交互式视频世界？","date":"2026-10-23","updated":"2026-10-23","summary":"Hy-Nomas 已开放模型资产，也给出单张 RTX 4090 方案，但本地运行仍有门槛。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-23-official-3a68097e4e1d/wordmark-wide-72c032bdaef5.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-23-official-3a68097e4e1d/wordmark-wide-72c032bdaef5.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"Hy-Nomas","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-Nomas","sourcePath":"posts/2026-10-23-official-3a68097e4e1d.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:2026-10-18-official-39d610a807a3","rawId":"obsidian:2026-10-18-official-39d610a807a3","slug":"2026-10-18-official-39d610a807a3","legacyPaths":[],"title":"腾讯 Hy-Memory-30B-A3B-FP8 已开放权重，适合拿来做什么？","date":"2026-10-18","updated":"2026-10-18","summary":"它不是通用聊天模型，而是负责筛选、改写和更新长期记忆的专用模型。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-18-official-39d610a807a3/wordmark-wide-58c20ac1cef6.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-18-official-39d610a807a3/wordmark-wide-58c20ac1cef6.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"Hy-Memory-30B-A3B-FP8","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","d